{"articleNo":"2423","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2423&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010학년도 1학기 등록금 분할납부 안내(신청 및 납부방법 변경되었습니다.)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.01.22","hit":"16633","attachments":[{"name":"분할납부신청서(학부,산업대학원,교육대학원용).tif","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2423&attachNo=1486"},{"name":"분할납부신청서(샘플).tif","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2423&attachNo=1924"},{"name":"분할납부신청서(일반대학원용).tif","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2423&attachNo=2025"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><strong><font size=\"3\">- 2010학년도 1학기 등록금 분할납부 안내</font> -<br>(<u>재학생</u>)</strong></font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">\n</font></p><table style=\"WIDTH: 398px; HEIGHT: 45px\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"398\" align=\"center\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n            <p align=\"center\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">분할납부신청 및 납부 방법이 변경되었습니다.&nbsp;</font></strong></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">\n<br><br>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 분할납부 신청기간 : <font color=\"#ff0000\"><u>02.01.(화)~02.12.(금) 오후 6시까지</u></font></span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 분할납부 신청방법 : <strong><font color=\"#ff0000\"><u>우편신청(방문신청과 병행)<br></u></font></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- <u><font color=\"#ff0000\">본인도장, 보호자도장을 반드시 찍어 주시기 바랍니다.<br></font></u>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;(본인 및 보호자도장이 없는 경우에는 분할납부를 신청할수 없음.)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- 우편신청시 주소 : 구미시 양호동 1번지 금오공대 경리팀<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (글로벌관 533호)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 방문신청시 :&nbsp;경리팀(글로벌관 533호)으로 오시기 바랍니다.<br></span></font><font face=\"굴림체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><br>3. 분할납부 고지서발급 : 원스톱서비스에서 발급, <u><strong>2월 16일부터 발급 예정</strong></u></span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 분할납부 납부기간 : 1차분을 납부기간에 납부하지 않을시 분할납부 신청이 취소됩니다.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 1차 : 02.16.(화)~02.19.(금)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2차 : 03.16.(화)~03.17.(수)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;- 3차 : 04.15.(목)~04.16.(금)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;- 4차 : 05.17.(월)~05.18.(화)</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">5. 분할납부 납부장소 : <font color=\"#ff0000\"><u>농협, 대구은행, 신한은행</u></font></span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">6. 분할 납부 금액 : 분할납부신청서 참조</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">7. 분할납부신청서 첨부해놨습니다.(절대 수정 불가)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학부, 산업대학원, 교육대학원용과 일반대학원용 신청서가 다릅니다.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 신청서 작성시 내용을 정확하게 작성하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">8. 2010학년도 1학기 <u>휴학시에는 등록금을 완납</u>하여야 합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">9. 2010학년도 1학기 재입학자 및 한국장학재단 학자금융자를 받는 학생은&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;분할납부를 신청할 수 없습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">10. 분할납부 문의전화 : 054-478-7115 (경리팀)</span></font></p>\n</font><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<font size=\"2\">\n<p align=\"center\"><br><br><br>2010. 1. 22.&nbsp;<br><br><br><font size=\"4\"><strong>총 &nbsp;무&nbsp; 과 &nbsp;장</strong></font> </p>\n</font>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
